1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Something is reproducing at 145 degrees Fahrenheit

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Incendiamoeba cascadensis, the fire amoeba

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
A complex cell, a eukaryote, like the cells in you

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,500
A new heat record for complex life

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:21,000
And it survives even hotter

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Complex life now has a higher known heat limit

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,500
Syracuse-led team, published in Cell

8
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:32,000
The limits of life keep moving
